{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本標準依身心障礙者權益保障法第五十七條第二項規定訂定之。","id":"D0070227/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"2cd3b73fba120a7f4a43cca9d32e74ea9e568d90093fa38b7c795751654921c9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070227/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":28,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"本標準所稱內政部主管活動場所（以下簡稱活動場所），指依都市計畫開闢使用之公園、綠地、廣場及經內政部公告國家公園內之場所。","id":"D0070227/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"1cd89756c259f206ea8468a4c9369677776f0d9d344a93d66065939826271c9b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070227/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":60,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"活動場所應依外部交通動線、停車空間等因素，設置至少一處主要出入口，並視環境條件及場所面積酌予增加，便利行動不便者及身心障礙者進出，其無障礙設施設備規格如下：\n一、人行動線以直線通達為原則，並使輪椅及輔具使用者得雙向同時通行，避免迂迴、設置旋轉門或障礙物；出入口人行淨高不得小於二點一公尺，淨寬不得小於一點五公尺，但因地形限制或管制僅容單向通行者，其淨寬不得小於零點九公尺。\n二、應設置等候轉向平臺，並有適當照明；平臺面積不得小於六平方公尺，各方向長度不得小於一點五公尺，坡度不得大於五十分之一。\n三、鋪面應利於輪椅及輔具使用者行進，其材質應堅硬、平整及具防滑效能；勾縫處應無高度落差，其寬度不得大於八公釐。\n四、設有階梯者，其梯級、扶手、欄杆及警示設施，準用建築物無障礙設施設計規範樓梯規定。\n五、設有坡道者，其傾斜方向應與行進方向一致，坡度不得大於二十分之一。但因地形限制，坡度不得大於十二分之一，並應加設扶手或公示應有輔助人員或輔具協助使用。\n六、禁止汽車、機車或自行車通行或停放者，應設置明顯告示。","id":"D0070227/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"bb7a854541b6c8f4c2faab4b7cbcad7679f412b87182cdad163d37cefbbaa63d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070227/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":452,"children":[{"id":"D0070227/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":79,"end":187,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":187,"end":248,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:3/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":248,"end":304,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:3/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":304,"end":347,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:3/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":347,"end":424,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:3/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":424,"end":452,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"活動場所應設置至少一條無障礙通路連結前條之主要出入口，並視環境條件及場所面積酌予增加，其無障礙設施設備規格如下：\n一、人行動線淨寬不得小於一點五公尺。但因地形限制僅容單向通行者，其淨寬不得小於零點九公尺，並於通視距離內設置等候轉向平臺，平臺設置應符合前條第二款規定。\n二、人行動線地面上方零點六公尺至二點一公尺範圍內，如有零點一公尺以上之懸空突出物，應設置警示及防撞設施。\n三、鋪面應符合前條第三款規定，坡度、排水及開口準用建築物無障礙設施設計規範室外通路及坡道規定。\n四、地面二側有使輪椅或輔具車輪陷落傾倒之虞者，應設置防護緣或安全護欄。\n五、與建築物室外主要通路不同時，應於室外主要通路入口處標示無障礙通路之方向。\n六、應在兒童遊戲設施及體育設施區域之外圍通過，避免直接穿越，並保持安全距離或設置防護設施。\n七、以人車分離為原則，其禁止汽車、機車或自行車通行或停放者，應設置明顯告示。","id":"D0070227/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"bf2bcfbb99c5e995f5afe76a8e78b99e77726b97f6b6608751c357c0a2855c08","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070227/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":394,"children":[{"id":"D0070227/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":57,"end":134,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":134,"end":187,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:4/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":187,"end":235,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:4/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":235,"end":271,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:4/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":271,"end":310,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:4/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":310,"end":356,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:4/p:1/i:7","kind":"item","number":7,"start":356,"end":394,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"活動場所於戶外設置之樓梯、升降設備、輪椅觀眾席位、停車空間、無障礙標誌及服務臺等設施設備，準用建築物無障礙設施設計規範。","id":"D0070227/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"b26a6bfa9bcdd4e965523a4f1f1598a8ee4c20d8cc52057b781b856c8ca61283","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070227/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":60,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"活動場所之觀景臺、休憩區、用餐區、兒童遊戲區及體健區，應保留輪椅與輔具使用者進出、停留及使用空間，其無障礙設施設備規格如下：\n一、出入口及鋪面設置應符合第三條規定。\n二、桌椅、洗手臺、飲水機、供輔具充電插座及求助鈴，應連接無障礙通路及等候轉向平臺周邊；其使用高度及距離，準用建築物無障礙設施設計規範輪椅正向與側向接近可及範圍規定。提供輪椅或輔具使用者獨力用餐使用者，應以正向接近設計。\n三、座椅扶手設計高度應在零點二公尺至零點三公尺。","id":"D0070227/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"aa38c01267995d11475fc58bc057e39031e24164ffd8887b126c2e885f73c9bf","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070227/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":217,"children":[{"id":"D0070227/a:6/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":63,"end":83,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:6/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":83,"end":193,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:6/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":193,"end":217,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"活動場所之主要出入口與無障礙通路周邊設置之地圖、告示牌、解說牌及標誌，應適合輪椅及輔具使用者靠近閱讀，牌面傾斜角度、字體及顏色應可清晰辨識，並得配合設置凸紋、點字或語音等設施設備。\n地圖應標示供輪椅及輔具使用者使用之主要出入口、無障礙通路路線圖及其他無障礙設施設備項目。","id":"D0070227/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"59ccc626d4015cdec263145ae952f4c9a649b210ce4dd0645a8a6aa3b13126c0","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070227/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":91,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070227/a:7/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":91,"end":135,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"於活動場所舉辦活動，管理機關及舉辦人增設臨時性之服務臺、廁所盥洗室、輪椅觀眾席位及停車空間等設施設備，應考量行動不便者及身心障礙者之通行及使用需求。","id":"D0070227/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"4b10e257451109c412d2a01a7d0be7c5be95c23ed68b5f8d4f74be7f5986158d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070227/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":74,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"本標準自發布日施行。","id":"D0070227/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"0760487a7e1a3f98a433704c163a939df3ca09942ff350f224457b344857930a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070227/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國一百零四年十月二十二日內政部台內營字第 1040815134 號令\n  訂定發布全文 9  條；並自發布日施行","id":"D0070227","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2015-10-22","name":"內政部主管活動場所無障礙設施設備設計標準","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0070227","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"6eb5397c20d3d2272e71f405d7014a0e1aa51d6bd02bcb33cc6dbe698e9af6b8","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2015-10-22","effectiveDate":""}}